      "message": "It might make sense to create a shared WFD vendor for this stack. As far as I understand, the system-side part is common, while the device-specific differences are mostly limited to vendor blobs and configuration.\n\nSomething like vendor/xiaomi/wfd-common could hold the shared WFD libraries, binaries, build files, and common configuration, with each device tree simply inheriting it.\n\nIf the WFD blobs across devices like are identical or ABI-compatible, this would also avoid duplicating the same stack in every device vendor tree.",
